---
const {project,card}=Astro.props;
const state={ownerId:project.owner_id,projectId:project.id,cardId:card.id,cardTitle:card.title,updatedAt:project.updated_at,image:project.settings?.local_artwork_v1?.cards?.[card.id]??null};
const size=project.settings?.visual_design_v1?.defaults;
const ratio=size&&Number(size.width)>0&&Number(size.height)>0?Number(size.width)/Number(size.height):2.75/4.75;
const serialized=JSON.stringify(state).replace(/</g,'\u003c');
---
<section class="local-artwork-card" data-local-folder-prototype><script type="application/json" data-project-artwork-state set:html={serialized}/><p class="eyebrow">Card artwork</p><h2>Artwork for {card.title}</h2><p>Choose the folder where you keep your artwork, then pick one image. Your full-size images stay on your computer.</p><div class="columns"><section><h2>1. Choose your artwork</h2><p data-capability></p><button class="primary" data-native-folder type="button">Choose artwork folder</button><input data-folder-snapshot type="file" multiple hidden data-folder-directory/><p>This sample uses one image at a time. Choosing a folder does not upload or add every image to your deck.</p><div data-folder-selection hidden><label>Choose an image from this folder<select data-folder-file><option>Choose an image</option></select></label></div><details><summary>Choose one image instead</summary><label>Select an image from your computer<input data-file type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp"/></label><p>Use this if you do not want to choose a folder, or your browser cannot open it. JPG, PNG or WebP up to 20 MB.</p></details><details><summary>Where are my images saved?</summary><p>Your original images stay in your own folder. This page saves a smaller preview and your position choices in this browser. It does not upload the full-size images or back up your folder. Keep your own backup. Your browser may ask you to choose the folder or image again next time.</p></details><div data-has-art hidden><p data-reference></p><h2>2. Position your image</h2><p>Move or enlarge the preview to see how it fits. Your original file stays unchanged.</p><label>Move left or right<input data-edit="x" type="range" min="-25" max="25" value="0"/></label><label>Move up or down<input data-edit="y" type="range" min="-25" max="25" value="0"/></label><label>Make the image larger<input data-edit="zoom" type="range" min="1" max="2" step="0.05" value="1"/></label><details><summary>Image access options</summary><button data-check type="button">Check full-size image</button><button data-release type="button">Forget this image location</button><p>This only forgets this page’s selection. It does not delete files or change your browser’s folder permissions.</p></details></div></section><aside><div class="card" style={`aspect-ratio:${ratio}`}><p data-empty>Your image will appear here.</p><img data-preview alt="Your chosen artwork preview" hidden/><span>{card.title}</span></div><p>A sample card preview. It is not a finished print file.</p><section data-has-art hidden><h2>Download your artwork</h2><button data-original-export type="button" disabled>Download full-size image and notes</button><p>To download your artwork at full quality, we need the original image used for this preview. If it has moved, we’ll ask you to choose it again.</p><details><summary>Save a small preview copy</summary><button data-working-export type="button" disabled>Download preview copy</button><p>This includes the small preview and position notes, not your original image.</p></details></section></aside></div><p data-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Choose an artwork folder to begin.</p><button class="primary" data-save-project type="button">Save artwork choices to this card</button><p>A small preview and your image choices are saved to this project. Your original stays in your folder.</p></section>
<script>document.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>("[data-folder-directory]").forEach(input => input.setAttribute("webkitdirectory", "")); import '../../../local-folder-prototype/desktopArtwork';</script>
<style>.local-artwork-card .columns{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem}.local-artwork-card aside{order:-1}.local-artwork-card .card{aspect-ratio:2.75/4.75;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--tok-studio-rule);background:#e8e9dc}.local-artwork-card .card img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.local-artwork-card .card span{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;padding:.6rem;text-align:center;background:#f8f4e8dd;font:1.3rem Georgia,serif}.local-artwork-card input,.local-artwork-card select{display:block;max-width:100%;margin-block:.5rem}.local-artwork-card label{display:block;margin-block:1rem}.local-artwork-card details{margin-block:1rem}.local-artwork-card summary{cursor:pointer;text-decoration:underline}.local-artwork-card button{padding:.6rem .8rem;min-height:44px;margin:.3rem 0;border:1px solid var(--tok-studio-rule);background:#eee9dc;color:var(--tok-studio-ink);cursor:pointer}.local-artwork-card button.primary{background:#c3a450}.local-artwork-card [data-status]{padding:.7rem;background:#e2ebe7}.local-artwork-card [hidden]{display:none!important}</style>